flowchart LR
    D0[Defender at present\nExisting motor / lamp / equipment\nCurrent operating cost] --> D1[Defender future years\nRepair, energy, maintenance\nResidual value]
    C0[Challenger at present\nNew efficient alternative\nInitial investment] --> C1[Challenger future years\nEnergy, maintenance, replacement\nResidual value]
    D1 --> A[Compare alternatives over common study period]
    C1 --> A
    A --> R[Choose lower present worth cost\nor higher net present worth]

